'''Incineroar ex''' (Japanese: '''ガオガエンex''' ''Gaogaen ex'') is a {{ct|Fire}} Stage 2 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Celestial Guardians}} expansion.

